  Process-Split Fragmentation  : P-1, P-2, P-3 ...
  Dual (supplementary)         : F-1, F-2, F-3 ...
  Retain / Unclear             : use the control own Control_ID as key

ASSESSMENT RULES
  Base classifications solely on information in the source data.
  Do not infer activities, dependencies, or relationships not described.
  Do not create relationships without sufficient supporting evidence.
  Look beyond wording differences — focus on underlying objective,
  activity, and risk outcome.
  Do NOT classify as Redundant/Fragmented/CCO without clear evidence.
  If insufficient evidence → Unclear.
  Apply classifications consistently across all controls in scope.

CONFIDENCE
  High   : Strong evidence
