  Low    : Limited evidence — treat as indicative only

OUTPUT RULES
  One assessment per control. No aggregation.
  Every control in the input must appear in assessments exactly once.
  Do not invent Control_IDs.
  fragmented_control_id_group: populate this for BOTH Process-Split
  Fragmentation AND Common Control Opportunity. List all Control_IDs
  in the same group, including the current control itself.
  redundant_by_control_ids: populate only for Redundant classification.
""".strip()

